:"6e5ebc94-8459-4363-b022-9c1a2b9acddf","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`type MyInt int` の MyInt が int と相互に変換できるとかは underlying type の機能の話になる、はず","ts":"1625044894.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uEwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc0faafe-95c8-4c78-ad66-2e533ab2598c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"predeclaredな型に単純に別名つけてdefined typeを作っても、他のdefined typeとは区別されないですね","ts":"1625044850.038100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U023Z8L90BG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vt2f="}]},{"client_msg_id":"975a6353-c586-4625-9925-0b694aceb508","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"なるほど。じゃあ既存の（名前付きの）型をそのまま定義しなおした型の呼称は結局公式には存在しないということですかね。","ts":"1625044802.037200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i8TX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91fbea79-c9b2-494e-8c2a-0a97a75ca679","type":"message","user":"U01PC2TUVV3","text":"名前なしで書く場合はtype literalですね\n例えばこういうやつ\n```a := struct{ A string}{ A: \"abc\"}```","ts":"1625044760.036600","edited":{"user":"U01PC2TUVV3","ts":"1625044890.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"THX0h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a3b0dd7-85b6-4194-8ed2-7244666655e9","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`struct{...}` は type literal でしたっけねたしか","ts":"1625044724.035200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wae"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20271f7f-103e-4652-83f9-032d2189e6d7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"含むでしょ(spec上は)","ts":"1625044719.035000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625044727.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CXCQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb20cfcb-2860-4d62-9c72-9289723e989f","type":"message","user":"U01PC2TUVV3","text":"含むのでは","ts":"1625044715.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YsaE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a68f05b-27d5-41cb-bbc5-523b48c80f4d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"含むのでは？","ts":"1625044708.034500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1df768d6-e3c0-4662-b87c-32a876653dc9","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"Defined Typeが僕の言っていたやつのことを指すのかな。これって `type T struct{…}` は含まないと思っていいのだろうか","ts":"1625044695.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+0z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"460824a6-9aea-467c-a705-4ee9baad9156","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"named type → defined type か","ts":"1625044689.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OOdM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"273968aa-fce0-4e92-8691-f82d579c4a4f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なんと\n1.11で変わってたのか呼び方","ts":"1625044657.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BPHz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c1bb32-2d50-4b51-9517-062707cb0860","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"経緯を説明してある記事を見つけました\n\u003chttps://budougumi0617.github.io/2020/02/01/go-named-type-and-type-alias/\u003e","ts":"1625044609.032400","attachments":[{"fallback":"[Go] Defined type（Named type）とType aliasを使い分ける - My External Storage","id":1,"title":"[Go] Defined type（Named type）とType aliasを使い分ける - My External Storage","title_link":"https://budougumi0617.github.io/2020/02/01/go-named-type-and-type-alias/","text":"Goには既存の型に新しい名前をつける方法が2つある。 type MyType intと宣言するDefined type 以前はNamed typeと言っていたが、Go1.11からDefined typeと呼ぶようになった type MyType = intと宣言するType alias すでにいろいろ記事はあるものの、最近数回聞かれることがあったので改めてまとめておく。","image_url":"https://budougumi0617.github.io/logos/Go-Logo_Aqua.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"budougumi0617.github.io","from_url":"https://budougumi0617.github.io/2020/02/01/go-named-type-and-type-alias/","original_url":"https://budougumi0617.github.io/2020/02/01/go-named-type-and-type-alias/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0VK+n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b4d5fd5-e9de-48e8-b9f1-48e134ca1e95","type":"message","user":"U01PC2TUVV3","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/commit/56c9b51b937cca7d3db517add96bd9517bbffb80\u003e","ts":"1625044577.032100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=8QFv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efe84aa0-ac95-4346-b3e7-5a4457d3660c","type":"message","user":"U01PC2TUVV3","text":"named typeが仕様書で置き換えられた経緯があるらしい","ts":"1625044575.031900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lmn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d07b132-f558-4a9f-998e-725211f4f4df","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"namedって感じだけど...ちがうんだろうな","ts":"1625044383.031500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jWO3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"624ac1e4-b959-46d1-b584-87e3ed625460","type":"message","user":"U01PC2TUVV3","text":"どうしても呼ぶなら、、型定義された型になりますかね。定義された型(defined type)だとint, float みたいなやつも含んでしまうので","ts":"1625044230.030900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"skDGZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e04e103a-9a68-481f-8653-cae2b7ef41f9","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"触り始めたときにそう呼びそうになったことはぶっちゃけあります… でもメソッド定義して元に及ばない時点でaliasではなさそうだなと思ってAST調べて色々と (`type X Y` と `type X struct { ... }` が同じ構文) 納得した。","ts":"1625044177.030200","edited":{"user":"U7H4TJEG0","ts":"1625044181.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e165849-ee77-4b15-9c8f-e2be8ce577e6","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"仕様ではなく通称ですね。英語圏の記事ググったらaliasと呼んでいる人がいたのでそう呼ぶのかと思った記憶があります。広く通じていたかどうかは今から考えると自信がないですね…。","ts":"1625043955.026400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JAyM+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cee8afc-0b9b-4514-8591-05f81b31a055","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕は呼んでない。","ts":"1625043654.024400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U023Z8L90BG"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wqZj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37cd2ade-2cd5-46df-a9d5-80f6188562fa","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"仕様としては無かったですが、別名を付ける (type A B) という意味の通称で alias と呼んでいる人もいたかもしれません。","ts":"1625043627.024100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O5H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fb7d670-8d3c-400f-87cf-20e55f344516","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分の記憶にもないですが、あってもおかしくはないですね","ts":"1625043377.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BPH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c899d1-d297-4408-b400-c34d5940dab1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"え、type alias 前にaliasって呼んでるものあった? (僕の記憶にはない)","ts":"1625043324.022900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625043333.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n=0s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96113fb1-c629-4040-a75f-6bf4a05465ca","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「定義された型」かなあ (spec によるとエイリアスは型定義ではないということになっている)","ts":"1625043259.022300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5=g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6aebe09-98eb-4c2e-be69-e76ab6b140b1","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"昔はそういう型のことをAliasと呼んでいたような記憶があります\n（が、Type Aliasが出来て以降そう呼ぶことは無くなりましたね）","ts":"1625043163.021500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RR3iY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06f732f2-2056-43d2-b0db-a2eeb300cd4c","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"なるほど…","ts":"1625043092.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tFcA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18ccddd8-d2a9-4253-9b86-458850046966","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"通称も多分ないと思いますね…","ts":"1625043020.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b7af"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c1cc218-a64f-4119-824e-0ba9f21d7c2d","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"通称でもいいんですけど、何と呼べばいいのかなあと。","ts":"1625042962.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X2dvt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6751b276-9849-43a7-8445-06c68df9bdd4","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"既存の型の構造を変えずにそのまま別名つけて作った型で、Type Aliasではない型、の呼び方が知りたかったんですね。","ts":"1625042936.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Chc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22f0a5f8-0cc1-4ca1-b854-0ee4e3af83e7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"はい","ts":"1625040481.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yV/+G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12df24f5-c86a-40d5-bb43-2bf61ea4c8f8","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"TypeDefか","ts":"1625040477.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sXx+b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4097c189-6e51-4fbe-ad47-8ea0f6c30b55","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"```TypeDecl = \"type\" ( TypeSpec | \"(\" { TypeSpec \";\" } \")\" ) .\nTypeSpec = AliasDecl | TypeDef .```","ts":"1625040456.016600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2KQV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"088d7e71-1443-4205-b226-eafc298012b6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`type X = uintptr` と `type X uintptr` の違い","ts":"1625040370.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bbRK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9840a39f-458a-4bc2-a318-e0936af8c873","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"エイリアスでない型定義によって定義された型をなんと呼ぶのかって話だと思ってた","ts":"1625040341.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Ori"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4275c9e1-7284-45f0-9cf8-d2dcf3cc8677","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"え、そうなんですか?","ts":"1625040328.015600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+83M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e58f398-6709-4c9a-a4c7-56ea45ec1ef6","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"`Y` と `struct { ... }` はどちらも型なので `type X Y` を `type X struct { ... }` から区別して呼ぶ名前はない (質問者のやりたいことはこれでは？) という認識でいます","ts":"1625040165.015200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p+N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d840e964-ebe5-466a-a969-447b171be1a0","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なので「type definitions によって定義された型」かな","ts":"1625039897.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cyq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37835a20-9006-4e2e-8bde-59ad5a31a30f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; A type declaration binds an identifier, the type name, to a type. Type declarations come in two forms: alias declarations and type definitions.","ts":"1625039884.013300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sILI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1e05a88-86d0-4f2c-bad7-a03f10475765","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"知りたいのは構文の名前じゃなくて型の名前では (そして名前がついていない可能性がある)","ts":"1625039751.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pkb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"892c4549-130b-4c9f-8b48-48b96f805fa4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なのでもしも厳密にいうなら「type aliasを除くtype declaration」が正しい、ということなるw","ts":"1625039634.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=PCT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e899168-2439-4732-8821-62e755b1bcb9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ですね。type aliasも型宣言の一部だけど、後から入ったから名前があるんじゃないかなぁ。","ts":"1625039592.011200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625039596.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3xQV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a34af44-072e-41cb-a8e9-15696c9e3ab6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"型宣言?","ts":"1625039469.010400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rGg1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a671fed-9f0a-43d2-9c78-9fe541de1a2f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"type declarationsですね。","ts":"1625039337.010000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ZhxK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b33dc301-4312-4769-9941-9815da4b19fb","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"エイリアスじゃないですね、`type X Y` 構文で定義する型をなんと呼べばいいんだろう","ts":"1625037774.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dJnj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4baf9120-bc08-475d-8b53-7cca2611094f","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"uintptrのエイリアスなら、でした。","ts":"1625037640.008700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RYu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efa229f9-e34e-4fbc-b87c-9f311ce64986","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"uintptrならレシーバーに出来るみたいですね。どういうときに活用できるのかは分かりませんが…。","ts":"1625037619.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y3OGd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a572bfd2-c346-409c-86f2-277e46117fbf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"埋め込むのか","ts":"1625021258.007600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yr+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd8f17ea-be33-4585-a966-dab40bbe373f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1625021250.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EBD1H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef9fe4be-2e73-498c-8432-580b6e284b1e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"さっきググったら `type B struct { *A }` っていう解決法もあったけど","ts":"1625020887.007200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1132bbc4-d15e-44f5-8584-f22ac13c5f00","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとaliasだともともとAが持ってたメソッドにはB経由ではアクセスできなくなってしまうという違いもあるか。","ts":"1625020862.006600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QQq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"247d69f7-b89b-4fdb-aaa4-f92b18ac01a9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"インダイレクトが自明じゃなくなってしまいそうですね。","ts":"1625020833.005900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3S7"}]},